{"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/adascripting"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"kind":"symbol","sections":[],"metadata":{"role":"collection","symbolKind":"module","externalID":"AdaScripting","modules":[{"name":"Ada Script"}],"title":"Ada Script","roleHeading":"Framework"},"abstract":[{"text":"Write gameplay systems in Ada Script while keeping entity filtering and access planning in AdaEngine’s native ECS.","type":"text"}],"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"minor":3,"patch":0},"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/AdaScripting\/documentation\/AdaScripting","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"hierarchy":{"paths":[[]]},"primaryContentSections":[{"content":[{"text":"Overview","type":"heading","anchor":"Overview","level":2},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Ada Script is AdaEngine’s scripting layer for gameplay and ECS integration. Its source files use the "},{"code":".ada","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" extension. The current implementation uses an embedded language runtime, while the public API, diagnostics, and tooling consistently present Ada Script concepts."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Annotations are not only syntax. AdaEngine resolves every query into native archetypes and component columns and publishes its component access to the scheduler."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Use Ada Script for gameplay rules that benefit from quick iteration. Keep rendering backends, custom data structures, and other low-level or performance-critical facilities in Swift."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"code":["@system(scheduler: \"update\")","class MovementSystem {","    @query(Transform, Movement)","    var movers;","","    func update(context) {","        for (var entity in movers) {","            var position = entity.transform.position;","            var velocity = entity.movement.velocity;","            position[0] += velocity[0] * context.deltaTime;","            position[1] += velocity[1] * context.deltaTime;","            entity.transform.position = position;","        }","    }","}"],"syntax":"ada","type":"codeListing"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"AdaEditor projects configure automatic script discovery by default. For an existing Swift package, follow "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/AdaScripting\/documentation\/AdaScripting\/GettingStartedWithAdaScript","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" to enable the build plugin and register the generated script plugins."}],"type":"paragraph"}],"kind":"content"}],"topicSections":[{"title":"Essentials","anchor":"Essentials","identifiers":["doc:\/\/AdaScripting\/documentation\/AdaScripting\/GettingStartedWithAdaScript","doc:\/\/AdaScripting\/documentation\/AdaScripting\/AdaScriptBasics","doc:\/\/AdaScripting\/documentation\/AdaScripting\/AdaScriptLanguage","doc:\/\/AdaScripting\/documentation\/AdaScripting\/AdaScriptAnnotations","doc:\/\/AdaScripting\/documentation\/AdaScripting\/AdaScriptLibraries"]},{"title":"ECS Integration","anchor":"ECS-Integration","identifiers":["doc:\/\/AdaScripting\/documentation\/AdaScripting\/AdaScriptECS","doc:\/\/AdaScripting\/documentation\/AdaScripting\/AdaScriptDiagnosticsAndPerformance","doc:\/\/AdaScripting\/documentation\/AdaScripting\/AdaScriptTesting"]},{"title":"Runtime API","anchor":"Runtime-API","identifiers":["doc:\/\/AdaScripting\/documentation\/AdaScripting\/AdaScriptPlugin","doc:\/\/AdaScripting\/documentation\/AdaScripting\/AdaScriptSource","doc:\/\/AdaScripting\/documentation\/AdaScripting\/AdaScriptError"]},{"title":"Articles","anchor":"Articles","identifiers":["doc:\/\/AdaScripting\/documentation\/AdaScripting\/NativeAOT"],"generated":true},{"title":"Classes","anchor":"Classes","identifiers":["doc:\/\/AdaScripting\/documentation\/AdaScripting\/AdaScriptNativePlugin","doc:\/\/AdaScripting\/documentation\/AdaScripting\/AdaScriptObjectCatalog","doc:\/\/AdaScripting\/documentation\/AdaScripting\/AdaScriptObjectReloadCandidate","doc:\/\/AdaScriptin